      "value": "@{62cbec9fb806110baae1748f|full_name}: I reported your issue to the developer of UdonSharp and it turns out that they cannot fix it because there is no unchecked cast available in Udon. This is the Canny that you should upvote for that to be possible: https://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-feedback/p/cast-nodes",
