      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5de9405aea7cc52772fcc359|full_name} This Canny can be merged with https://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-feedback/p/cast-nodes because it is a known problem in the UdonSharp compiler which cannot be fixed until Udon gives access to unchecked castings. \n\nRight now, the UdonSharp compilers need to turn `+= 1` operations on bytes into `System.Convert` instead which is causing the error, instead of being able to use an unchecked conversion that C# would use in that case.\n\nThis is what the code above currently turns into using UdonSharp:\n\n`SystemByte.__op_Addition__SystemByte_SystemByte__SystemInt32`\n\n`SystemConvert.__ToByte__SystemInt32__SystemByte`",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
