  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-07-09T13:08:45.194Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "If you perform an overflow operation on a variable of type integer, an error occurs.\n\nIt is nonsense to use Mathf.Repeat every time to avoid it.\n\nTry chath and unchecked are both blocked, which is inconvenient.\n\nThe code and error message to be reproduced are as follows\n\n```\n\nbyte test = 255;\n\ntest += 1;\n\n```\n\n```\n\nValue was either too large or too small for an unsigned byte.\n\n```",
